      "rule": "the first top-level Grid the block variant renders (evaluated with its props, nested organisms and slots followed, only decided branches, nothing inside an each) is the root: beside it only the head of a section (Title, Text, Group, Link, Button, Badge, Separator, Inline, text); its children are exactly one each; the module has no span; its Cols evaluate to a kit Grid value whose widest step has 3 or more equal columns"
